  "modified": "2026-09-16T09:45:56Z",
  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: denial of service in the MVG/SVG renderer when a bezier\n     control-point coordinate delta is out of range\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-25985.patch: reject an out-of-range coordinate\n       delta before the (size_t) conversion, release points/coefficients on\n       the error paths instead of raising a fatal exception, and refresh\n       primitive_info after the CheckPrimitiveExtent() reallocation, in\n       TraceBezier() in magick/draw.c\n     - CVE-2026-25985\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: off-by-one boundary check in the double-to-integer cast\n     helpers leading to an undefined conversion\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-25989.patch: make the upper-bound guard of\n       CastDoubleToUnsigned() and CastDoubleToLong() exclusive of the boundary\n       value in magick/image-private.h\n     - CVE-2026-25989",
